title: "CGM Clinical Safety Reanalysis"
type: software
version: 1.0.2
date-released: 2026-08-09
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Audit-focused clinical-safety evaluation code, DTS Error Grid implementation,
  aggregate manuscript Tables 2–6, tests, and reconstruction scripts accompanying
  the JDST manuscript on re-evaluating CGM forecasting through event prediction
  and cross-population generalization.
repository-code: "https://github.com/modalfuse/cgm-clinical-safety-reanalysis"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21859991
keywords:
  - continuous glucose monitoring
  - clinical safety
  - DTS Error Grid
  - hypoglycemia
  - event prediction
  - matched specificity
  - cross-population generalization
